summary:
- topic: Board Welcome and Announcements
  text: The Board welcomed new member Eleni Richardson and announced key upcoming
    dates, including the next Regular School Board Meeting on June 9th and the School
    Budget Referendum on June 10th.
- topic: School Budget Referendum Information
  text: Superintendent Mr. Matheney shared details on the School Budget Referendum,
    noting that voting will take place exclusively at the community center and highlighting
    online resources available for public review.
- topic: Teacher Resignations
  text: The Board accepted the resignations of three experienced teachers from Kaler
    and Small schools, with administration clarifying that these departures were not
    due to budget-related reductions in force.
- topic: Confidential HR Assistant Role
  text: The Board approved the creation of a part-time confidential human resources
    assistant job description, which is part of a central office reorganization aimed
    at reducing overall salary expenditures.
- topic: Executive Session and Adjournment
  text: "The Board voted to enter into executive session pursuant to MRSA\xA7405(6)(A)\
    \ to discuss a confidential personnel matter before adjourning the meeting."
